; OLD TUSK (S1 seam 3, sl-0104; docs/23 the designer's naming act):
; the great scarred boar of the SE mud pocket — Green's world boss.
; Three phases on the proven Warden recipe (never a stat wall):
; P1 THE CHARGER — a fast chaser whose whole identity is the tusk
;   sweep cone (get beside him, never in front);
; P2 THE RAGE — faster, and the gore rush (INTERCEPT) punishes
;   committed straight-line running;
; P3 THE MIRE — wounded and slower, but the mud itself fights (the
;   blight_zone hazard IS the mud vocabulary — shared with shroom,
;   arm 45 exactly, the pattern->lead law holds) and the sweeps
;   come denser. All numbers [T]; speeds 3.2 max < the 3.6 floor.

